{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "Reaper Soulrend preserves Reaped Souls and Soul Infusion on a missed cast (#7497)",
  "contract": [
    "Soulrend 572342 (REAPER_ALL_SOUL_CONSUMERS member, AttributesEx7 SPELL_ATTR7_NO_ATTACK_DODGE and",
    "SPELL_ATTR7_NO_ATTACK_PARRY, DmgClass SPELL_DAMAGE_CLASS_MELEE) can only be avoided by a plain miss,",
    "whose chance is capped at 60% by Unit::MeleeSpellMissChance regardless of the level/skill gap.",
    "A level-60 Reaper with no hit or expertise rating against a stationary level-83 target reaches that",
    "60% cap, so 50 independently re-primed casts land between roughly 1 and 49 times with overwhelming",
    "statistical certainty (both extremes are below 2^-31).",
    "ConsumeReaperSouls (AscensionCompat.cpp) must only remove the Reaped Soul (500363) and Soul Infusion",
    "(803031) auras when the cast was not avoided by every target; before the fix it removed them on",
    "every cast regardless of hit/miss. Each trial re-primes both auras immediately before casting, so the",
    "server only ever records an aura_removed event for a trial whose cast actually landed: the number of",
    "aura_removed events for each spell must equal the number of landed hits exactly, not the trial count."
  ],
  "timeout_ms": 240000,
